<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    Line icons from the Feather set, the same drawings react-icons ships as
    `react-icons/fi` (MIT). They are inlined rather than pulled from a package
    so the dashboard adds no dependency and the icons take their colour from
    the text around them.

    Every glyph here is vertically symmetric or direction-neutral, so nothing
    needs mirroring when the dashboard renders right-to-left.
-->
